88722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 8192, "score": 21, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 11:53", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "继续看，这块不属于我的节奏<br/>[img]./mon_202608/24/axyfQ47-jr6hK1aT3cSsg-o8.jpg[/img]", "lou": 110, "content_length": 66, "attachs": [{"attachurl": "mon_202608/24/axyfQ47-jr6hK1aT3cSsg-o8.jpg", "size": 47, "type": "img", "subid": 0, "url_utf8_org_name": "temp3515047Screenshot_2026_0824_115122.png", "dscp": "", "path": "mon_202608/24", "name": "axyfQ47-jr6hK1aT3cSsg-o8.jpg", "ext": "jpg", "thumb": "120", "hash": ""}], "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787543632}, {"pid": 879465999, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 43, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 15:57", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "[E1787558464 0 0]\t", "content": "上午还说这里抄睡不踏实，下午美美一觉醒来发现还真打到3850区域了，后面还有新低会入场接一点，之后大概盘中会有不少的诱多窗口，甚至明天可能就出现，但是我暂时不看到4000了，因为那根百点阴线有点断节奏，如果抱着看到4000的预期做可能会舍不得卖甚至害自己被套在诱多途中，所以暂且按选择接受踏空卖飞的方式去做", "lou": 111, "content_length": 294, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787558246}, {"pid": 879471804, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 15, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 16:43", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879468610,47288722,1384]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67198839]cookingvi[/uid] (2026-08-24 16:18):[/b]<br/><br/>P佬，高度你看到多少[/quote]<br/><br/>都卖飞策略了，高度就是感觉利润满足了有压力了就走，不去预判了", "lou": 112, "content_length": 65, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879468610, "postdatetimestamp": 1787561036}, {"pid": 879534451, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 16, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 10:23", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "按计划操作接了一层且已t出", "lou": 113, "content_length": 25, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787624607}, {"pid": 879537025, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 11, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 10:41", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879465999,47288722,1384]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67145714]Plezl[/uid] (2026-08-24 15:57):[/b]<br/><br/>上午还说这里抄睡不踏实，下午美美一觉醒来发现还真打到3850区域了，后面还有新低会入场接一点，之后大概盘中会有不少的诱多窗口，甚至明天可能就出现，但是我暂时不看到4000了，因为那根百点阴线有点断节奏，如果抱着看到4000的预期做可能会舍不得卖甚至害自己被套在诱多途中，所以暂且按选择接受踏空卖飞的方式去做[/quote]<br/><br/>昨日预判基本实现，盘面有点脆弱，持续性不敢锐评，所以接了还要敢t，采取宁卖飞策略", "lou": 114, "content_length": 84, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879465999, "postdatetimestamp": 1787625714}, {"pid": 879539092, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 12, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 10:57", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879538182,47288722,1427]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=65719506]andkaic[/uid] (2026-08-25 10:50):[/b]<br/><br/>P佬 我等苟命流派弟子申请空仓 请指示！[/quote]<br/><br/>想空就空呗，本来这里就是在4，你不亏钱甚至还赚点就跑赢很多人了，这么一想是不是就觉得没必要执拗于现阶段盘面了", "lou": 115, "content_length": 112, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879538182, "postdatetimestamp": 1787626620}, {"pid": 879548030, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 14, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 12:00", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "上周说看空达子财报后的科技，现在来看可能已经提前反应了，没法确定，真是博博又弈弈啊，今明两天就是反弹窗口期了，还不行那也没招", "lou": 116, "content_length": 124, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787630411}, {"pid": 879558047, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 29, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 13:41", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "都在给量化刷语料是吧<br/>反正别追而且记得今天4000普涨算沸点[del]涨多少你别管[/del]第二天分化就行了", "lou": 117, "content_length": 89, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787636503}, {"pid": 879559345, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 25, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 13:55", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "没话讲～<br/>我们互相在假装～", "lou": 118, "content_length": 24, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787637307}, {"pid": 879592035, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 15, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 19:00", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "讨论业绩？设备基本都没有业绩预期啊，不是看它投入生产资金之类的吗，虽然我也不是很懂就是了，不过我看的这方面博主月初就说科创的业绩基本会很差了<br/>目前看下来前面出业绩的好像都原谅了", "lou": 119, "content_length": 174, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787655601}], "__T": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "topic_misc": "AgLQUfU", "subject": "自立自强，科学技术打头阵----救赎版", "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 134283296, "replies": 37097, "authorid": 150058, "postdate": 1785481814, "lastpost": 1788251595, "jdata": null, "author": "-阿狼-", "lastposter": "kaleColourWgw", "digest": 0, "lastmodify": 1788251682, "tpid": 0, "topic_misc_var": {"2": 47206901}, "__ST": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47206901, "topic_misc": null, "subject": false, "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 33792, "replies": 9, "authorid": 58, "postdate": 1784343019, "lastpost": 1788251328, "jdata": "{\"sto\": 47212166}", "author": "zeg", "lastposter": "用户名都被占了", "digest": 0, "lastmodify": 1785639284, "tpid": 0, "__P": {"aid": "a:3:{i:1;i:28;i:2;s:13:\"154.12.38.134\";i:0;i:510567;}", "score": 5, "score_2": 1, "content": "[size=130%][b]浪奔浪流 顺应趋势 技术分析 临时讨论 [color=darkred]勿转时事[/color][/b][/size]", "alterinfo": "", "post_misc_var": {"content_length": 28, "fid": 510567, "userip": "154.12.38.134"}, "recommend": 0, "type": 33792, "authorid": 58, "postdate": 1784343019, "subject": false, "pid": null, "tid": 47206901, "fid": 510567}, "post_misc_var": {"content_length": 28, "fid": 510567, "userip": "154.12.38.134"}}, "post_misc_var": {"content_length": 354, "fid": 510567, "14": {"14": 4, "13": 10, "17": 4, "12": 2, "11": 2, "10": 2, "15": 1}, "16": "63818397,64626166,672